    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Flickering flames streak toward a creature of your choice within range. Choose one of the following effects:</p><p><strong>Healing Flames.</strong> The target regains 2d6 Hit Points.</p><p><strong>Searing Flames.</strong> Make a ranged spell attack against the target. On a hit, it takes 2d8 Fire damage.</p><p><strong>Using a Higher-Level Spell Slot.</strong> For every two spell slot levels above 1, you can choose one additional target: two targets with a level 3 or 4 slot, three with a level 5 or 6 slot, four with a level 7 or 8 slot, and five with a level 9 slot. You choose the effect separately for each target.</p><section class=\"secret\" id=\"secret-cXsEwhI1T4dKMiVk\"><p><strong>Foundry Note</strong></p><p>With several targets, use each activity on its targets; the second one used doesn’t spend another slot (uncheck it).</p></section>",
      "chat": ""
    },
